00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:51,880
So the whole thing about men asking for directions, why do you think men don't like to ask for directions?

225
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:59,140
Well, it depends on the person, but I think a lot of people don't like to admit that they don't know.

226
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:03,400
Because if you ask for directions, it means I don't know where I'm going.

227
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:04,220
